    "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 422.161995,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，咱们盘了。第十到第六大报恩寺的琉璃塔，天坛龙江宝船厂武当山明长城。好多朋友看完在评论区炒翻了。有人说紫禁城呢永乐大典呢，郑和下西洋呢？别急，今天这集就是第五道第一，一个比一个震撼。最后那个是咱们至今都还在用的。老规矩，开讲讲之前，麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听第五名。郑和下西洋，永乐三年，公元一四零五年，朱棣下旨令郑和组织船队下西洋。船队有多大？两百多艘船，两万七千多人，最大的宝船长一百多米，比哥伦布的船大了好几倍。哥伦布第一次出海是一四九二年，郑和比他早了。八十七年船队从南京出发，经过福建穿过南海，到了爪哇苏门答腊西兰，鼓里最远到了非洲东海岸，前后七次，历时二十八年访问了三十多个国家和地区，带去了丝绸、瓷器、茶叶，带回了香料珍宝。长颈鹿。一支船队把大明的国威扬到了半个地球。第四名，明长陵在北京昌平天寿山朱棣不仅给子孙修了紫禁城，还给自己修了一座陵。明长陵永乐七年度宫地下宫殿，修了四年地面建筑，修到宣德二年才完工。前后将近十八年。陵宫占地十二万平方米，是十三陵里规模最大、营建最早的一座长陵的冷殿，全用金丝楠木建成六十根大柱。最粗的直径一米多，一个人抱都抱不过来，六百年了木头还带着香一座长陵，是朱棣留给自己的归宿。第三名永乐大典朱棣不光修宫殿、修陵墓还修书。永乐元年，他下令节俭，姚广孝主持编纂一部大书，要樊书弃以来经史子集百家之术。至于天文地质、阴阳医补升道记忆之言，被即为一书。吴厌浩凡前后动用了两千一百多人，历时五年全书两万两千九百三十七卷，装订城一万一千零九十五册总字数，大约三亿七千万字，汇集了先秦到明初的典籍。七八千种全都是书手，用楷书一笔一画抄出来的。不列颠百科全书称它为世界有史以来最大的百科全书，一部大典把中国几千年的知识全装了进去。讲了这么多，您可能也发现了这些工程背后称一个都有讲不完的故事。长城怎么修的？大运河怎么通的，紫禁城怎么盖的？视频里只能讲个大概，要是您想多知道一点，我手边有本中华文化常识一千问，分门别类，一问一答，把中国历史上的文化常识讲的清清楚楚。讲城大运河、紫禁城书里都有中老年朋友，看着正合适，每天翻两页，心里就有谱了。已经放下面了，点开就能看到喜欢历史的弄一本放床头，随手翻一页就是一段历史。第二名，京杭大运河从北京到杭州，朱棣迁都北京以后，北京粮食不够吃怎么办？从南方运和元朝修的运河，好多河段淤塞了，走不了船。永乐九年，朱棣下令疏郡会通河公部上书送礼，带队征发十六万丁夫，把从济宁到临清三百八十五里的河道重新打通，又听从汶上老人白英的建议，在岱村筑坝，引汶水入运河，解决了水源问题。永乐十三年，运河全线畅通。从此以后，南方的粮食。丝绸、茶叶一船一船往北京运，没有这条河，朱棣的北京城就站不住一条运河，是迁都的底气。第一名，北京紫禁城永乐四年，公元一四零六年，朱棣下诏，营建北京宫殿，这就是紫禁城。这一修修了十四年，征调了十万工匠，上百万兵丁劳工，有的石头一块就种两百多吨，两万民工和一千多头骡子拖了二十八天才运到工地。金丝楠木从四川湖广的深山里砍下来，顺着长江飘到北京。占殿修好以后，占地七十二万平方米，房屋九千多间。太和殿、中和殿、保和殿三大殿，一字排开，红墙黄瓦层层叠叠。六百年过去了，明清两朝二十四个皇帝在这儿住过。今天，他叫故宫，是世界上现存规模最大、保存最完整的木结构宫殿建筑群。每年上千万人从全世界各地来看他一座紫禁城，是朱棣留给中国最大的礼物。您听出来了没有？这十件大事，没有一件是随便干的。大报恩赐的琉璃塔是面母，天坛是敬天，龙江宝，船厂是造箭，武当山是重道，明长城是守边，郑和下西洋是通史，明长陵是归处，永乐大典是修文，京杭大运河是通曹，紫禁城是丽都，每一件事都不只是一个工程，是朱棣对这片土地的理解，点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00001",
      "start_ms": 190,
      "end_ms": 650,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00002",
      "start_ms": 650,
      "end_ms": 1330,
      "text": "咱们盘了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00003",
      "start_ms": 1330,
      "end_ms": 5190,
      "text": "第十到第六大报恩寺的琉璃塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5390,
      "end_ms": 9690,
      "text": "天坛龙江宝船厂武当山明长城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10490,
      "end_ms": 13110,
      "text": "好多朋友看完在评论区炒翻了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13270,
      "end_ms": 16410,
      "text": "有人说紫禁城呢永乐大典呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00007",
      "start_ms": 16450,
      "end_ms": 17730,
      "text": "郑和下西洋呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00008",
      "start_ms": 17890,
      "end_ms": 18390,
      "text": "别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00009",
      "start_ms": 18910,
      "end_ms": 21690,
      "text": "今天这集就是第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00010",
      "start_ms": 21930,
      "end_ms": 23310,
      "text": "一个比一个震撼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00011",
      "start_ms": 24210,
      "end_ms": 28110,
      "text": "最后那个是咱们至今都还在用的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00012",
      "start_ms": 28590,
      "end_ms": 29310,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00013",
      "start_ms": 29670,
      "end_ms": 30660,
      "text": "开讲讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00014",
      "start_ms": 31120,
      "end_ms": 34180,
      "text": "麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00015",
      "start_ms": 34660,
      "end_ms": 38740,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听第五名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00016",
      "start_ms": 39040,
      "end_ms": 40160,
      "text": "郑和下西洋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00017",
      "start_ms": 40400,
      "end_ms": 41300,
      "text": "永乐三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00018",
      "start_ms": 42200,
      "end_ms": 43880,
      "text": "公元一四零五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00019",
      "start_ms": 44620,
      "end_ms": 47820,
      "text": "朱棣下旨令郑和组织船队下西洋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00020",
      "start_ms": 48600,
      "end_ms": 49620,
      "text": "船队有多大？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00021",
      "start_ms": 50580,
      "end_ms": 51600,
      "text": "两百多艘船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00022",
      "start_ms": 51880,
      "end_ms": 53160,
      "text": "两万七千多人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00023",
      "start_ms": 53680,
      "end_ms": 56320,
      "text": "最大的宝船长一百多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00024",
      "start_ms": 56620,
      "end_ms": 58900,
      "text": "比哥伦布的船大了好几倍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00025",
      "start_ms": 59380,
      "end_ms": 62585,
      "text": "哥伦布第一次出海是一四九二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00026",
      "start_ms": 63600,
      "end_ms": 64980,
      "text": "郑和比他早了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00027",
      "start_ms": 64980,
      "end_ms": 68445,
      "text": "八十七年船队从南京出发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00028",
      "start_ms": 68910,
      "end_ms": 71025,
      "text": "经过福建穿过南海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00029",
      "start_ms": 71660,
      "end_ms": 75280,
      "text": "到了爪哇苏门答腊西兰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00030",
      "start_ms": 75660,
      "end_ms": 78960,
      "text": "鼓里最远到了非洲东海岸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00031",
      "start_ms": 79200,
      "end_ms": 80375,
      "text": "前后七次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00032",
      "start_ms": 80670,
      "end_ms": 84995,
      "text": "历时二十八年访问了三十多个国家和地区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00033",
      "start_ms": 85490,
      "end_ms": 88455,
      "text": "带去了丝绸、瓷器、茶叶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00034",
      "start_ms": 88810,
      "end_ms": 90685,
      "text": "带回了香料珍宝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00035",
      "start_ms": 90990,
      "end_ms": 91655,
      "text": "长颈鹿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00036",
      "start_ms": 92090,
      "end_ms": 96375,
      "text": "一支船队把大明的国威扬到了半个地球。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00037",
      "start_ms": 96800,
      "end_ms": 97495,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00038",
      "start_ms": 97880,
      "end_ms": 104155,
      "text": "明长陵在北京昌平天寿山朱棣不仅给子孙修了紫禁城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00039",
      "start_ms": 104540,
      "end_ms": 106285,
      "text": "还给自己修了一座陵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00040",
      "start_ms": 106790,
      "end_ms": 110210,
      "text": "明长陵永乐七年度宫地下宫殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00041",
      "start_ms": 110210,
      "end_ms": 112800,
      "text": "修了四年地面建筑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00042",
      "start_ms": 113040,
      "end_ms": 115275,
      "text": "修到宣德二年才完工。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00043",
      "start_ms": 116130,
      "end_ms": 117615,
      "text": "前后将近十八年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00044",
      "start_ms": 118270,
      "end_ms": 121010,
      "text": "陵宫占地十二万平方米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00045",
      "start_ms": 121090,
      "end_ms": 126325,
      "text": "是十三陵里规模最大、营建最早的一座长陵的冷殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00046",
      "start_ms": 126730,
      "end_ms": 130035,
      "text": "全用金丝楠木建成六十根大柱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00047",
      "start_ms": 130350,
      "end_ms": 132245,
      "text": "最粗的直径一米多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00048",
      "start_ms": 132590,
      "end_ms": 134065,
      "text": "一个人抱都抱不过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00049",
      "start_ms": 134800,
      "end_ms": 139335,
      "text": "六百年了木头还带着香一座长陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00050",
      "start_ms": 139690,
      "end_ms": 142135,
      "text": "是朱棣留给自己的归宿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00051",
      "start_ms": 142810,
      "end_ms": 149065,
      "text": "第三名永乐大典朱棣不光修宫殿、修陵墓还修书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00052",
      "start_ms": 149570,
      "end_ms": 150545,
      "text": "永乐元年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00053",
      "start_ms": 151200,
      "end_ms": 152760,
      "text": "他下令节俭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00054",
      "start_ms": 153250,
      "end_ms": 156135,
      "text": "姚广孝主持编纂一部大书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00055",
      "start_ms": 156880,
      "end_ms": 160640,
      "text": "要樊书弃以来经史子集百家之术。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00056",
      "start_ms": 160700,
      "end_ms": 166175,
      "text": "至于天文地质、阴阳医补升道记忆之言，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00057",
      "start_ms": 166550,
      "end_ms": 167675,
      "text": "被即为一书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00058",
      "start_ms": 168010,
      "end_ms": 171225,
      "text": "吴厌浩凡前后动用了两千一百多人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00059",
      "start_ms": 171850,
      "end_ms": 175855,
      "text": "历时五年全书两万两千九百三十七卷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00060",
      "start_ms": 176340,
      "end_ms": 180930,
      "text": "装订城一万一千零九十五册总字数，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00061",
      "start_ms": 181090,
      "end_ms": 182830,
      "text": "大约三亿七千万字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00062",
      "start_ms": 183190,
      "end_ms": 186070,
      "text": "汇集了先秦到明初的典籍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00063",
      "start_ms": 186490,
      "end_ms": 188930,
      "text": "七八千种全都是书手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00064",
      "start_ms": 189190,
      "end_ms": 191810,
      "text": "用楷书一笔一画抄出来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00065",
      "start_ms": 192210,
      "end_ms": 197790,
      "text": "不列颠百科全书称它为世界有史以来最大的百科全书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00066",
      "start_ms": 197910,
      "end_ms": 202870,
      "text": "一部大典把中国几千年的知识全装了进去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00067",
      "start_ms": 203790,
      "end_ms": 204670,
      "text": "讲了这么多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00068",
      "start_ms": 204910,
      "end_ms": 211940,
      "text": "您可能也发现了这些工程背后称一个都有讲不完的故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00069",
      "start_ms": 212320,
      "end_ms": 213560,
      "text": "长城怎么修的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00070",
      "start_ms": 213680,
      "end_ms": 215060,
      "text": "大运河怎么通的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00071",
      "start_ms": 215220,
      "end_ms": 216560,
      "text": "紫禁城怎么盖的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00072",
      "start_ms": 216860,
      "end_ms": 218460,
      "text": "视频里只能讲个大概，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00073",
      "start_ms": 218780,
      "end_ms": 220320,
      "text": "要是您想多知道一点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00074",
      "start_ms": 220460,
      "end_ms": 223560,
      "text": "我手边有本中华文化常识一千问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00075",
      "start_ms": 224220,
      "end_ms": 225160,
      "text": "分门别类，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00076",
      "start_ms": 225340,
      "end_ms": 226180,
      "text": "一问一答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00077",
      "start_ms": 226720,
      "end_ms": 230980,
      "text": "把中国历史上的文化常识讲的清清楚楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00078",
      "start_ms": 231300,
      "end_ms": 236240,
      "text": "讲城大运河、紫禁城书里都有中老年朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00079",
      "start_ms": 236280,
      "end_ms": 237380,
      "text": "看着正合适，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00080",
      "start_ms": 237620,
      "end_ms": 238820,
      "text": "每天翻两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00081",
      "start_ms": 239160,
      "end_ms": 240470,
      "text": "心里就有谱了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00082",
      "start_ms": 240710,
      "end_ms": 242010,
      "text": "已经放下面了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00083",
      "start_ms": 242110,
      "end_ms": 246330,
      "text": "点开就能看到喜欢历史的弄一本放床头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00084",
      "start_ms": 246890,
      "end_ms": 249130,
      "text": "随手翻一页就是一段历史。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00085",
      "start_ms": 250210,
      "end_ms": 250810,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00086",
      "start_ms": 251050,
      "end_ms": 254630,
      "text": "京杭大运河从北京到杭州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00087",
      "start_ms": 254810,
      "end_ms": 256550,
      "text": "朱棣迁都北京以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00088",
      "start_ms": 257270,
      "end_ms": 260570,
      "text": "北京粮食不够吃怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00089",
      "start_ms": 261830,
      "end_ms": 265050,
      "text": "从南方运和元朝修的运河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00090",
      "start_ms": 265470,
      "end_ms": 267390,
      "text": "好多河段淤塞了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00091",
      "start_ms": 267550,
      "end_ms": 268290,
      "text": "走不了船。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00092",
      "start_ms": 268650,
      "end_ms": 269430,
      "text": "永乐九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00093",
      "start_ms": 270000,
      "end_ms": 273840,
      "text": "朱棣下令疏郡会通河公部上书送礼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00094",
      "start_ms": 273840,
      "end_ms": 276220,
      "text": "带队征发十六万丁夫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00095",
      "start_ms": 276740,
      "end_ms": 281120,
      "text": "把从济宁到临清三百八十五里的河道重新打通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00096",
      "start_ms": 281760,
      "end_ms": 284220,
      "text": "又听从汶上老人白英的建议，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00097",
      "start_ms": 284620,
      "end_ms": 286020,
      "text": "在岱村筑坝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00098",
      "start_ms": 286480,
      "end_ms": 288000,
      "text": "引汶水入运河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00099",
      "start_ms": 288520,
      "end_ms": 289960,
      "text": "解决了水源问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00100",
      "start_ms": 290920,
      "end_ms": 291880,
      "text": "永乐十三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00101",
      "start_ms": 292080,
      "end_ms": 293560,
      "text": "运河全线畅通。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00102",
      "start_ms": 293920,
      "end_ms": 294700,
      "text": "从此以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00103",
      "start_ms": 294920,
      "end_ms": 295955,
      "text": "南方的粮食。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00104",
      "start_ms": 296330,
      "end_ms": 299850,
      "text": "丝绸、茶叶一船一船往北京运，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00105",
      "start_ms": 300590,
      "end_ms": 301470,
      "text": "没有这条河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00106",
      "start_ms": 301770,
      "end_ms": 305010,
      "text": "朱棣的北京城就站不住一条运河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00107",
      "start_ms": 305430,
      "end_ms": 306990,
      "text": "是迁都的底气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00108",
      "start_ms": 307490,
      "end_ms": 308070,
      "text": "第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00109",
      "start_ms": 308470,
      "end_ms": 310410,
      "text": "北京紫禁城永乐四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00110",
      "start_ms": 310590,
      "end_ms": 312249,
      "text": "公元一四零六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00111",
      "start_ms": 312630,
      "end_ms": 313510,
      "text": "朱棣下诏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00112",
      "start_ms": 313810,
      "end_ms": 315190,
      "text": "营建北京宫殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00113",
      "start_ms": 315630,
      "end_ms": 316690,
      "text": "这就是紫禁城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00114",
      "start_ms": 317310,
      "end_ms": 319510,
      "text": "这一修修了十四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00115",
      "start_ms": 319850,
      "end_ms": 321490,
      "text": "征调了十万工匠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00116",
      "start_ms": 321650,
      "end_ms": 323350,
      "text": "上百万兵丁劳工，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00117",
      "start_ms": 323930,
      "end_ms": 327040,
      "text": "有的石头一块就种两百多吨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00118",
      "start_ms": 327360,
      "end_ms": 334100,
      "text": "两万民工和一千多头骡子拖了二十八天才运到工地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00119",
      "start_ms": 334420,
      "end_ms": 339980,
      "text": "金丝楠木从四川湖广的深山里砍下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00120",
      "start_ms": 340360,
      "end_ms": 342360,
      "text": "顺着长江飘到北京。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00121",
      "start_ms": 342780,
      "end_ms": 344280,
      "text": "占殿修好以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00122",
      "start_ms": 344520,
      "end_ms": 346500,
      "text": "占地七十二万平方米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00123",
      "start_ms": 346860,
      "end_ms": 348520,
      "text": "房屋九千多间。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00124",
      "start_ms": 348820,
      "end_ms": 352780,
      "text": "太和殿、中和殿、保和殿三大殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00125",
      "start_ms": 352960,
      "end_ms": 353800,
      "text": "一字排开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00126",
      "start_ms": 354760,
      "end_ms": 357405,
      "text": "红墙黄瓦层层叠叠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00127",
      "start_ms": 357980,
      "end_ms": 359235,
      "text": "六百年过去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00128",
      "start_ms": 359490,
      "end_ms": 362795,
      "text": "明清两朝二十四个皇帝在这儿住过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00129",
      "start_ms": 363110,
      "end_ms": 363550,
      "text": "今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00130",
      "start_ms": 363890,
      "end_ms": 364725,
      "text": "他叫故宫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00131",
      "start_ms": 365220,
      "end_ms": 372065,
      "text": "是世界上现存规模最大、保存最完整的木结构宫殿建筑群。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00132",
      "start_ms": 372750,
      "end_ms": 378425,
      "text": "每年上千万人从全世界各地来看他一座紫禁城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00133",
      "start_ms": 378850,
      "end_ms": 381825,
      "text": "是朱棣留给中国最大的礼物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00134",
      "start_ms": 382470,
      "end_ms": 383570,
      "text": "您听出来了没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00135",
      "start_ms": 383590,
      "end_ms": 384655,
      "text": "这十件大事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00136",
      "start_ms": 384990,
      "end_ms": 387165,
      "text": "没有一件是随便干的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00137",
      "start_ms": 387440,
      "end_ms": 390690,
      "text": "大报恩赐的琉璃塔是面母，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00138",
      "start_ms": 390770,
      "end_ms": 392565,
      "text": "天坛是敬天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00139",
      "start_ms": 393140,
      "end_ms": 393860,
      "text": "龙江宝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00140",
      "start_ms": 393860,
      "end_ms": 395405,
      "text": "船厂是造箭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00141",
      "start_ms": 395810,
      "end_ms": 397535,
      "text": "武当山是重道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00142",
      "start_ms": 397980,
      "end_ms": 399705,
      "text": "明长城是守边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00143",
      "start_ms": 400220,
      "end_ms": 402465,
      "text": "郑和下西洋是通史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00144",
      "start_ms": 402980,
      "end_ms": 405035,
      "text": "明长陵是归处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00145",
      "start_ms": 405450,
      "end_ms": 407735,
      "text": "永乐大典是修文，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00146",
      "start_ms": 408070,
      "end_ms": 410450,
      "text": "京杭大运河是通曹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00147",
      "start_ms": 410770,
      "end_ms": 412495,
      "text": "紫禁城是丽都，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00148",
      "start_ms": 413060,
      "end_ms": 415815,
      "text": "每一件事都不只是一个工程，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00149",
      "start_ms": 416200,
      "end_ms": 418680,
      "text": "是朱棣对这片土地的理解，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00150",
      "start_ms": 419380,
      "end_ms": 420160,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3c999cc0540ce2a7_s00151",
      "start_ms": 420420,
      "end_ms": 422055,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
